### Final Reset Procedure
1. **Close PCP Nexus**: The database is locked while the app is active.
2. **Clear Database**: I will wipe the [jobs](file:///C:/Homebrew%20Apps/PCP%20New/PCP%20Mobile%20Work/PCP_LEAN_DEV_TRANSFER/Source/Orchestrator/verify_comments_diag.py#7-39) table to ensure a clean status report.
3. **Move Emails**: Move target emails to the Inbox.
4. **Remove Categories**: Ensure emails do not have the `PCP-Processed` category (otherwise they will be skipped).
5. **Restart & Monitor**: Start the app and verify real-time logs in `C:\Homebrew Apps\PCP New\Logs`.
